                                "sense_id": "3f14b57d-7e20-36cc-ae8d-bad9166c9a31",
                                "text": "They generly had on yellow straw hats most as wide as an umbrella, but didn't wear no coats nor waistcoats, they called one another Bill, and Buck, and Hank, and Joe, and Andy, and talked lazy and drawly, and used considerable many cuss words."
